"primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209814103", "author": {"steamid": "76561198419508143", "personaname": "不跟挂玩", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198419508143/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 183992, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1086, "playtime_at_review": 137875, "last_played": 1787839853, "avatar": "92f8b6db521993faced56858dd5cb8f78ee4f462"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "少有的能治电子阳痿的游戏", "timestamp_created": 1763782321, "timestamp_updated": 1763782321, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504716992378234863", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209761400", "author": {"steamid": "76561199064493267", "personaname": "饭吃了没有", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199064493267/", "num_games_owned": 125, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1627, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1627, "last_played": 1756446445, "avatar": "e59efd0869c422a9304219f6f4e831f955068aad"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不值这个价，在同类游戏上玩法创新基本没有，在求生之路2的基础添加了一下卡组玩法，怪物种类并不丰富，主要就分为小怪，精英怪（类似与boom，口水，牛之类的）和boss怪，种类不要太少了。其中小怪的分类是真的无聊就和求生之路的丧尸一样，没有跟深的分类了。精英怪的种类也是少的可怜，甚至没有地图独有的特色精英，其刷新的模式还是和求生类似（按时间在周边刷新）这种刷新模式太老套了，就不应该存在在20年。boss怪更是一坨，除了大基本没有什么威胁，他不像tank一样有什么特殊的攻击机制。枪械上面，没有什么独特的科技武器，没有令人愉悦的搞怪武器，也没有像进几期游戏一样能对枪械进行自己理解的部件设计，，只有老一套带有年代感的武器设计，还有维几可以更换的零件，跟换也是没界面的只有捡起和换下。辅助道具更是老东西了，二战用的东西还拿在现在的作品里。 最最最重点工作室是不是打算跑路了22年最后一次更新后，到现在快26年了也就24年有两次小补丁，这工作室到底在干什么阿，就这样的态度谁还感买下一个作品？", "timestamp_created": 1763728427, "timestamp_updated": 1772829181, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.576372265815734863", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "209761389", "author": {"steamid": "76561198115507481", "personaname": "王欣欣欣", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198115507481/", "num_games_owned": 348, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 926, "last_played": 1720048678, "avatar": "b50e3a25184c2015058159c3bc9daf33d0f5901f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "所有图都体验过一遍就在也没啥新鲜感了，武器翻来覆去也就那么几个。没什么养成系统，如果能深化一下bd的玩法，卡组构建什么的会更好。", "timestamp_created": 1763728412, "timestamp_updated": 1763728412, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495283037424087524", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}